					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >　　　　　　　<span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/15e523eb469cdb781c479187e19cd381.avif?t=1787491640" width=407 height=199 /></span><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin="anonymous" poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.poster.avif?t=1787491640" width=800 height=225 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.webm?t=1787491640" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>⬜︎ Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >A place where cherished robots spend their final days, the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Elis</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/725befe92603be9ae2c25faf747179d1.avif?t=1787491640" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras_big/725befe92603be9ae2c25faf747179d1.avif?t=1787491640 width=800 height=522 /></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>⬜︎ Your Role</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><u>🖤 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>⬜︎ A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>⬜︎ Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >🕒 <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					AI was used in the following areas:<br />
	•	Generation of in-game scripts<br />
	•	Translation of the Steam store page into English and Simplified Chinese				</i>
			</p>
